{"is_source_file": true, "format": "Python", "description": "This file implements a Python wrapper around the libmpv media player library. It provides a class MPV for controlling playback, managing events, properties, and commands, and handling overlays and streams. It also includes low-level ctypes definitions for interfacing with libmpv, error handling, and data structures for MPV events and render context. The code manages the lifecycle of mpv handles, event processing, property observation, and command execution, making libmpv accessible from Python with asynchronous and event-driven features.", "external_files": ["ctypes", "ctypes.util", "os", "sys", "warnings", "functools", "contextlib", "concurrent.futures", "collections", "re", "traceback", "queue", "threading"], "external_methods": ["ctypes.util.find_library", "ctypes.CDLL", "collections.defaultdict", "collections.deque", "re.search", "re.match", "warnings.warn", "traceback.format_exc", "functools.partial", "functools.wraps", "contextlib.contextmanager", "queue.Queue", "sys._getframe", "re.fullmatch"], "published": ["__version__", "ErrorCode", "MpvEventID", "MpvFormat", "MpvEvent", "MpvNode", "MpvEventProperty", "MpvEventLogMessage", "MpvEventEndFile", "MpvEventStartFile", "MpvEventClientMessage", "MpvEventCommand", "MpvEventHook", "MpvRenderParam", "MPV", "ShutdownError", "EventOverflowError", "property_observer", "unobserve_property", "unobserve_all_properties", "register_message_handler", "unregister_message_handler", "message_handler", "register_event_callback", "unregister_event_callback", "event_callback", "on_key_press", "key_binding", "register_key_binding", "unregister_key_binding", "register_stream_protocol", "play", "playlist_filenames", "playlist_append", "python_stream", "python_stream_catchall", "play_bytes"], "classes": [{"name": "ErrorCode", "description": "Defines error and success codes for libmpv interactions, with helper methods for human-readable messages and exceptions."}, {"name": "Mp